---
title: Meadow barley bowl
servings: 4
tags:
  - grain
  - weeknight
source:
  kind: invented
  note: synthetic fixture for the kitchen-erp test suite
---

= Grain

Rinse @pearl barley{1 1/2%cups} under cold water and tip it into a #saucepan{}.

Cover with @water{4%cups} and a pinch of @salt, bring to the boil and simmer for ~{35%minutes}.

= Dressing

Whisk @lemon juice{2%tbsp} with @olive oil{3%tbsp}(the peppery kind) and @honey{1%tsp}.

Fold the dressing through the warm barley with @parsley{a handful}(chopped) and @feta{100%g}.
